# Ignore everything by default: this folder accumulates .mhtml page captures
# and console logs that contain real patient names (PHI). Only explicitly
# whitelisted files may enter git.
*

# --- whitelisted ---
!.gitignore
!athelas-insights-helper.user.js
!AGENTS.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!DEPLOYMENT.md
!package.json

!athelas-insights-helper-extension/
!athelas-insights-helper-extension/**

!tests/
!tests/**

!redesign/
!redesign/PLAN.md
!redesign/DOM-FACTS.md
!redesign/procedure-matching.js
!redesign/procedure-matching.test.js
!redesign/procedure-matching-QUESTIONS.md
!redesign/procedure-audit.md
!redesign/BRIDGES-review.md
!redesign/COMPACT-MODE-POSTMORTEM.md
# NOT whitelisted: redesign/dom-*.html (real chart-note DOM dumps -> PHI)

# never these, even inside whitelisted dirs
node_modules/
*.log
*.mhtml
*.zip
*.new
*.tmp

# PHI captures live here (console logs, .mhtml page saves, chart-note DOM dumps).
# Redundantly ignored as a whole folder in addition to the *.log/*.mhtml rules
# above - a belt-and-suspenders guard so real patient data can never be committed.
captures/
captures/**
